 <dtrn>Adaptableness, suitableness. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>adaptation</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>adaptation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fitness, suitableness, appropriateness, aptness, adaptability, conformableness, conformability, accommodation, harmony.</dtrn>
