 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Adding, joining, etc. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>add</kref>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Accession, increase, augmentation, enlargement, extension. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>addendum</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
