<ar><k>almoner</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Alms-dispenser, distributor of alms, dispenser, distributor.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>almost</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Nearly, toward, towards, well-nigh, all but, for the most part, not quite, within a little.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alms</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Charity, benefaction, gratuity, gift, dole, bounty, charitable donation, eleemosynary aid.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>almsgiving</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Charity, beneficence, benefaction, benevolence.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>almshouse</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
