<ar><k>aloft</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Above, overhead, on high, in the air, in the sky, skyward, heavenward, in heaven.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alongside</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Naut.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>By the side of, side by side.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>aloof</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Apart, at a distance, away, off.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>aloud</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Audibly, distinctly, in a clear voice, with full voice.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Loudly, vociferously, sonorously, clamorously, obstreperously, at the top of the voice, with a loud voice.</dtrn></ar>
