 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Before that time.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>also</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Likewise, too, besides, furthermore, moreover, in addition, in like manner.</dtrn></ar>
