<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Sacrificial structure, place of sacrifice <i>or</i> offering.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Shrine, sacred place, place of worship, sanctuary, Holy of Holies, <i>sanctum sanctorum</i>, inmost <i>adyta</i>, inner <i>penetralia</i>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Communion-table, holy table, Lord's table.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alterable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Changeable, variable, mutable. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>alter</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alterant</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Alterative.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alteration</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Change, variation, modification, deviation, variance, turn, mutation, vicissitude.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alterative</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Alterant.</dtrn></ar>
