<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Reciprocation, interchange.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alternative</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Choice <c c="gray">(<co><i>between two things</i></co>)</c>, other <c c="gray">(<co>of two</co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>although</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>conj.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Though, albeit, notwithstanding, grant that, for all that, be it so, even if, even supposing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>altitude</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Height, elevation, loftiness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alto</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Mus.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Counter, counter-tenor, second, contralto.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>altogether</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Wholly, quite, completely, entirely, totally, utterly, thoroughly, throughout, fully, perfectly, <i>in toto</i>, out and out, to the full.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Conjointly, in the aggregate, in sum total, in a body, in a mass, <i>en masse</i>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>altruism</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Devotion to others, love of others, philanthropy, unselfishness, public spirit.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>altruistic</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Referring to altruism, marked by the theory of devotion to others.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Devoted to others, philanthropic, unselfish, friendly to man, attached to the common weal.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>alumina</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Oxide of aluminum, argillaceous earth, argil.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>aluminous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Clayey, argillaceous.</dtrn></ar>
