 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Large, great, capacious, wide, extended, extensive, spacious, broad, roomy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Plentiful, plenteous, abundant, abounding, overflowing, copious, full, liberal, rich, exuberant, luxurious, lavish, bountiful, generous, liberal, handsome.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Diffusive, unrestricted, not contracted, not condensed, not concise, copious, grandiose.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>amplification</k>
