 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Entertain, divert, please, charm, gladden, cheer, enliven, solace, beguile, relax, recreate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Beguile, deceive <c c="gray">(<co><i>by inspiring false hopes</i></co>)</c>, delude, cheat, inveigle, mislead, impose upon.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>amusement</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Entertainment, diversion, <i>divertissement</i>, sport, play, fun, frolic, merriment, pleasure, merry-making, recreation, relaxation, pastime, game.</dtrn></ar>
