 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Deficiency of blood, poverty of blood, bloodlessness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>anaemic</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Indicating anaemia, anaemied, deficient in blood, thin-blooded, bloodless.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>anaesthesia</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>anaesthesis</b>)</c>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Insensibility <c c="gray">(<co><i>as that produced by the inhalation of sulphuric ether, chloroform, etc</i>.</co>)</c>, unconsciousness of pain, suspended sensibility, suspended consciousness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>analect</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co>[<i><c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c> Analects</i> or <i>Analecta</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Selection, extract, selected piece, select piece. In <i>pl</i>., collection of literary fragments.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>analogical</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Having analogy, resembling, by analogy, corresponding, similar.</dtrn></ar>
