<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Decompose, decompound, dissect, resolve.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>anaphrodisiac</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Antaphrodisiac, passion-queller, lust-quencher.</dtrn></ar>
