 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Dissect.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Scrutinize, analyze, sift, probe, examine, lay open.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>anatomy</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Dissection.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Structure, structural form, structural plan, structural details.</dtrn>
