<ar><k>applicable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>To be applied <i>or</i> fitted <i>or</i> put on, adjustable.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Suitable, fit, fitting, befitting, appropriate, adapted, apt, proper, pertinent, relevant, apposite, germane, to the point, to the purpose, bearing on.</dtrn></ar>
