 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fix, determine, prescribe, set, establish.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Direct, ordain, enjoin, require, command, decree, order, bid, impose, insist on.</dtrn>
