 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Decree, bidding, command, order, ordaining, ordainment, ordination, ordinance, direction, precept, mandate, edict, enactment, law, requirement.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Equipment, equipage, furniture, outfit, accoutrement, appliance.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Allowance, salary, pay, stipend, pension. [<co>Proper only in <i><c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c></i></co><c c="gray">]</c></dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>apportion</k>
