 <dtrn>Distribution, allotment, assignment, partition, division.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>apposite</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Apt, pertinent, relevant, fit, fitting, befitting, suitable, appropriate, seasonable, germane, <i>apropos</i>, pat <c c="gray">(<co><i><c c="green"><abr>colloq.</abr></c></i></co>)</c>, to the purpose, to the point, well applied, well put.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>appraisal</k>
