 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Seizure, capture, taking, taking to one's self.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Application, <c c="gray">(<co><i>to a particular use</i></co>)</c>, assignment, devotion, allotment.</dtrn>
