 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Commend, recommend, praise like, appreciate, value, prize, think well <i>or</i> favorably of, think highly of, speak well of, be pleased with.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sanction, confirm, justify, ratify, uphold sustain, make valid, assent <i>or</i> consent to, concur in, indorse.</dtrn></ar>
