 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Turn, disposition, genius, gift, knack, endowment, talent, faculty, capacity, capableness, tendency, inclination, bent, bias, proclivity, proneness, propensity, forte, aptness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Readiness <c c="gray">(<co><i>at learning</i></co>)</c>, quickness, cleverness, ability, aptness.</dtrn></ar>
