 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Exile, expatriate, ostracize, expel from the country.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Exclude, expel, dismiss, dispel, shut out, drive away, put out of mind.</dtrn></ar>
