<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hoodman-blind, blind-man-buff.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>blindside</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Weakness, foible, failing, defect, weak side, weak point.</dtrn></ar>
