 <dtrn>Swaggerer, bully, boaster, braggart, vaunter, roisterer, huff, braggadocio, drawcansir, fire-eater, fanfaron, noisy fellow, bouncer <c c="gray">(<co><i><c c="green"><abr>colloq.</abr></c></i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
