<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Windy, stormy, tempestuous, squally, gusty, tumultuous, turbulent, noisy, roaring.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Swaggering, boasting, bragging, braggart, blattering, pompous, assuming, important, arrogant, swelling, big, bullying, vaporing, self-sufficient.</dtrn></ar>
