<ar><k>body</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Material substance, material part <c c="gray">(<co><i>as distinguished from the spirit or life</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Carcass, corpse, dead body.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Visible form <i>or</i> frame.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Trunk <c c="gray">(<i><co>as distinguished from the limbs</co></i>)</c>, stem, bole.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Bulk, main part <c c="gray">(<co><i>as distinguished from subordinate parts</i></co>)</c>, greater part.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Person, being, individual, mortal, creature.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Company, band, party, coterie, society, association, corporation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">8. </c> <dtrn>System, summary, general collection.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">9. </c> <dtrn>Consistency, thickness, substance.</dtrn></ar>
