 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Compassion, pity, tenderness, mercy, mercifulness, feeling, fellow-feeling, sympathy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>bower</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Arbor, shady recess, shady retreat, summer-house.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Bow-anchor, working-anchor.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Knave <c c="gray">(<co><i>of the trump color</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>bow-hand</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Archery</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>The left hand.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Mus.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>The right hand.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>bowl</k>
