 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Suspenders, gallowses.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Straps <c c="gray">(<co><i>on which a carriage rests</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
