<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Stenography, tachygraphy, tacheography, shorthand.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>bracing</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Strengthening, invigorating, stimulating.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brackets</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c> <c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Printing</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Crotchets.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brackish</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Saltish, somewhat salt.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>braggadocio</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Boaster, blusterer, vaunter, braggart, bouncer, vaporer, blatterer, gascon, vain-glorious fellow.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Brag. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>boast</kref>, <i>n.</i></dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brahm</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i>Hindoo <c c="green"><abr>Mythol.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>The Eternal, the Self-existent, the Supreme Original, the Immaterial Substance, God.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brahma</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i>Hindoo <c c="green"><abr>Mythol.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>The Creator, the Creative deity, the Formative Energy in God.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brahman</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>brahmin</b>)</c>
 <c><co>[Written also <i>Bramin</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Hindoo priest.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>braid</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Plait, plat, intertwine, interweave, interlace, weave together.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>brain-fever</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Phrenitis, meningitis.</dtrn></ar>
