<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Cemetery, grave-yard, burying-ground, church-yard, necropolis, God's Acre.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>burin</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Graver, style.</dtrn></ar>
