 <dtrn>Cemetery. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>burial-ground</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>bury the hatchet</k>
 <dtrn>Make peace, be reconciled, sheathe the sword, put up the sword.</dtrn></ar>
