 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Half-boot <c c="gray">(<co><i>especially one with high soles, worn by the ancient tragedians</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Tragedy, tragic drama.</dtrn></ar>
