 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Dressed in buskins.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Rare</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Tragic.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>busybody</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Meddler, intermeddler, meddlesome person, officious person, prig.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>butchery</k>
