<ar><k>cacophonous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Harsh, grating, discordant, cacophonic <c c="gray">(<co>al</co>)</c>, cacophonious.</dtrn></ar>
