 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Discord, jarring, jar, harsh sound.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Rhet.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Inharmonious phraseology, discordant diction.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cadaver</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Corpse, dead body, body, remains, subject <c c="gray">(<co><i>for dissection</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cadaverous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Pale, pallid, wan, ghastly, death-like.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>caddice</k>
