 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>It.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Cottage, small house, lodge.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Club-house, gaming-house, dancing-hall, dancing-saloon.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cask</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Hooped, wooden vessel <c c="gray">(<co><i>as a hogs-head, butt, pipe, tun, barrel, keg, etc.</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Helmet. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>casque</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>casket</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Little box.</dtrn></ar>
