 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fortress, citadel, stronghold, fortified residence.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Rook <c c="gray">(<co><i>in chess</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>castle-builder</k>
