 <dtrn>Visionary, dreamer, enthusiast, fanciful projector.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cast off</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Reject, discard, abandon, forsake, renounce, lay aside, cast by, cast away, throw away, throw by, get rid of.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Naut.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Loose, untie, let go, let slip.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cast-off</k>
