 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Caster, small wheel <i>or</i> swivel <c c="gray">(<co><i>on which furniture is rolled</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Castoreum.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>castoreum</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>L.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c> <c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Castor.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cast out</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Eject, expel, oust, turn out of doors.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Send forth, throw out, eject, hurl out <i>or</i> forth.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>castrate</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
