 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Chance, fortuity, contingency hap, unforeseen event.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Accident, disaster, misfortune, calamity, mischance, catastrophe.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>catachrestic</k>
