 <dtrn>Cold in the head.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>catastrophe</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Upshot, issue, consummation, conclusion, termination, <i>dénouement, finale</i>, winding up, finishing stroke, final event.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Disaster, misfortune, mishap, mischance. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>calamity</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>catch at</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Grasp at, try to seize, snatch at, snap at.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Be eager to get, be eager for, snatch at, snap at, jump at.</dtrn></ar>
