 <dtrn>Alligator.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ceaseless</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Incessant, unceasing, uninterrupted, continual, continuous, unintermitting, unremitting.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Perpetual, eternal, endless, everlasting, never-ending, interminable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cedar-bird</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>American wax-wing <c c="gray">(<co><c c="green"><i>Bombycilla Carolinensis</i></c> or <c c="green"><i>Ampelis Carolinensis</i></c></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
