<ar><k>cespitose</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>cespitous</b>)</c>
 <dtrn>Turfy, turfy-like.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cessation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Stoppage, stop, intermission, remission, suspension, pause, rest, respite, discontinuance, ceasing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cession</k>
