 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Surrender, relinquishment, yielding, renunciation, abandonment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Grant, conveyance.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cestus</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>L.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Girdle <c c="gray">(<co><i>especially the girdle of Venus</i></co>)</c>, belt, cincture, band.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Gauntlet, boxing-glove.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>chaffer</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Higgle, haggle, bargain, negotiate.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>chains</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c> <c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fetters, bonds, irons, shackles, manacles, bondage, captivity, thraldom, durance, duress, prison, constraint.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>chair</k>
