 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Buffoon, fool, harlequin, jester, droll, punch, zany, scaramouch, merry-andrew, jack-pudding, pickle-herring, mime, pantaloon, jack-a-dandy, wearer of the motley, <i>farceur, grimacier</i>.</dtrn></ar>
