 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pitying, compassionating, etc.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Compassion, sympathy, pity, condolence, fellow-feeling.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>commissioner</k>
