 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Agent, delegate, deputy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Member of the commission.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>commissure</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Seam, joint, closure, suture, conjunction, juncture.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>commit</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Intrust, consign, confide, give in trust.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Deposit, consign, resign, give over, put, place, lay.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Perpetrate, enact, do, perform.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Imprison, send to prison, put in custody, place in confinement.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Engage, pledge, implicate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Compromise, endanger, bring into danger, put at hazard, put in jeopardy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Place <i>or</i> put in charge of <i>or</i> hand over to a committee.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>commitment</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Delivering, intrusting, placing in charge.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Imprisonment, committal, placing in confinement, putting in custody.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Giving in adhesion, unreserved adherence, pledged relation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Reference to a committee.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>committal</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Intrusting, depositing, perpetrating, etc. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>commit</kref>, in all its senses.</dtrn></ar>
