 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Exchange.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Replace <c c="gray">(<co><i>a greater punishment by a less</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>companion</k>
