<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Assemblage, assembly, body, gathering, collection, group, circle, troop, crew, gang, set, concourse, congregation.</dtrn>
