 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Comparing, able to compare.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Judged by comparison, relative.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Founded in comparison, general.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>comparatively</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>By comparison, relatively.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>comparison</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Collation, compare, relative estimate, comparative estimate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Simile, similitude.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>compartment</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
