<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Abridgment, compendium, conspectus, summary, abstract, epitome, digest, synopsis, syllabus, breviary, brief, sum and substance.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>compendious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Brief, concise, short, abridged, summary, succinct, comprehensive.</dtrn></ar>
