<ar><k>compensation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Recompense, remuneration, reward.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Requital, satisfaction, indemnity, atonement, indemnification, reparation, amends.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Counterpoise, balance, equalization.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>compete</k>
