<ar><k>compilation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Compiling, selecting and combining, selection and combination <c c="gray">(<co><i>of literary matter</i></co>)</c>, book-making.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Selection <c c="gray">(<co><i>of literary matter</i></co>)</c>, book of selections, <i>or</i> excerpts <i>or</i> extracts.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>compile</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Write <c c="gray">(<co><i>by selecting from other works</i></co>)</c>, prepare, compose, draw up, get up.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Select and arrange, collect together, combine.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>complacence</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>complacency</b>)</c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Satisfaction, gratification, pleasure, content, contentment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Complaisance, civility, courtesy, politeness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>complacent</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pleased, satisfied, gratified, contented.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Complaisant, civil, polite, courteous, affable, easy, obliging, urbane, gracious.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>complain</k>
