 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Transmutation, transformation, change.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Interchange, transposition, reversal.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Change of religion.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Change of heart, regeneration, new birth.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Application, appropriation, employment.</dtrn></ar>
