 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Interchange, transpose, reverse, turn about.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Appropriate, apply.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>convertible</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
