 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Bark of the <i>Quercus suber</i>, or cork-tree, epiphloeum.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Stopple <i>or</i> stopper <c c="gray">(<co><i>made of cork</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Frost-nail <c c="gray">(<co><i>in a horse-shoe</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
