 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Oppose, contravene, resist, cross, thwart, hinder, check, defeat, frustrate, traverse, run counter to, act against, clash with.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Neutralize, destroy the effect of, annul.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>counteraction</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Opposition, contravention, resistance, frustration.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>counteractive</k>
