 <dtrn>Cramp.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>cranberry</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Bog-berry, moor-berry, moss-berry.</dtrn></ar>
