 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Rare</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Crapulent, drunken, drunk, inebriated, intoxicated, surfeited with drink.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crass</k>
