 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Originator, maker.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>The First Cause, the Maker, the Supreme Original. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>god</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>creature</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Being <c c="gray">(<co><i>animate</i> or <i>inanimate</i></co>)</c>, created being.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Animal, living being.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Man, person.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Dependant, retainer, vassal, parasite, minion, hanger-on.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Wretch, miscreant, piece of baseness.</dtrn></ar>
