 <dtrn>Trustworthiness, credibleness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>credible</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Trustworthy, reliable, to be believed, worthy of belief, not improbable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>credibleness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Trustworthiness, credibility.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>creditable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Reputable, honorable, estimable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>credulity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Ease in believing, readiness to believe <c c="gray">(<co><i>on slight evidence</i></co>)</c>, credulousness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>credulous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Easily convinced, too ready to believe, over-trustful, lax in seeking evidence, easily duped.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>creed</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Belief, tenets, dogmas, doctrines, system of opinions, summary of belief, <i>Credo</i>.</dtrn></ar>
