 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Felony, aggravated misdemeanor, gross offence <c c="gray">(<co><i>especially against human law</i></co>)</c>, infraction of law.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sin, transgression, iniquity, wickedness, unrighteousness, wrong, delinquency <c c="gray">(<co><i>of a violent</i> or <i>high-handed nature</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
