<ar><k>crosswise</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Across, transversely, over.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crotch</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fork, angle, corner.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crotchet</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Whim, freak, quirk, quirk, vagary, whimsey, fancy, caprice, maggot in the brain.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crotchety</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Whimsical, fantastic, fantastical, odd, queer, fanciful, capricious, humorsome, wayward, fitful, freakish.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crouch</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Couch, squat, lie flat, stoop low, lie close to the ground.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Cower, cringe, fawn, truckle.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>croup</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Rump <c c="gray">(<co><i>especially of a horse</i></co>)</c>, buttocks, crupper.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Cynanche <c c="gray">(<co><i>trachealis</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>crow</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Boast, brag, vaunt, bluster, swagger, vapor, triumph, gasconade, chuckle, exult.</dtrn></ar>
