<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Depreciation, derogation, detraction, undervaluing, underrating.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Lessening, diminution, detraction, derogation, impairment, injury, worsening, prejudice, harm.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Reproach, aspersion, defamation, calumny, vilification.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Reproach, indignity, dishonor, disgrace, dispraise.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>disparity</k>
