 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unsymmetrical, ill-proportioned, out of proportion.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co>[With <i>to</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Out of proportion, lacking proportion, incommensurate <c c="gray">(<co><i>with</i></co>)</c>, improperly proportioned, unsuitable, lacking proper adjustment <i>or</i> adaptation, ill-adapted.</dtrn>
