 <dtrn>Dissoluble, capable of liquefaction.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>dissonance</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Discord, discordance, harshness, jarring, want of harmony.</dtrn>
