 <c><co>[<i>Said of men</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Weakness, softness, timidity, unmanly delicacy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>effervesce</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Froth, foam, bubble, ferment, bubble and hiss.</dtrn></ar>
