 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Barren, unprolific, unfruitful, fruitless, addle.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Decayed, spent, exhausted, wasted, worn out.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>efficacious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Effectual, effective, powerful, active, operative, efficient, energetic, of adequate power.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>efficacy</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Potency, competency, power, strength, force, efficiency, effectiveness, energy, vigor, virtue.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>efficiency</k>
