 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Image, figure, statue, representation, likeness, portrait, effigies.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sepulchral statue, mortuary statue.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>effloresce</k>
