 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Bloom, flower, burst into bloom, break into flower.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Break into florid ornament, become florid.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Chem.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Grow pulverulent <c c="gray">(<co><i>on the surface</i></co>)</c>, acquire a bloom <i>or</i> down.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>efflorescence</k>
