 <dtrn>Brilliancy, lustre, splendor, brightness, radiance, refulgence.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>effulgent</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Brilliant, shining, lustrous, splendid, resplendent, bright, radiant, refulgent, dazzling, blazing, flaming, glowing, burning, beaming.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>effusion</k>
