 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Outpouring, efflux, gush.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Shedding, spilling, waste, effuse.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Utterance, expression of thought <i>or</i> sentiment, desultory composition <i>or</i> effort <c c="gray">(<co><i>literary</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>effusive</k>
