 <c c="blue">1. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Properly</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>One or the other <c c="gray">(<co><i>of two</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i>Less authorized</i>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Any one <c c="gray">(<co><i>of several</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co>[<i>Archaic or poetical</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Each <c c="gray">(<co><i>of two</i></co>)</c>, both, one and the other.</dtrn></ar>
