<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Voter, constituent.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>electric</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Charged with electricity.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Marked by electricity, relating to electricity.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Full of fire <i>or</i> spirit, inspiriting, inspiring, stimulating.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Lightning-like, swift and flashing, instantaneous and thrilling, rousing, thrilling, stirring, exciting.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>electrify</k>
