 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>exceptional</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excess</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Superfluity, redundance, redundancy, superabundance, disproportion, undue amount.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Surplus, overplus, remainder.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Intemperance, immoderation, over-indulgence, dissoluteness, dissolute behavior <i>or</i> living, dissipation, debauchery.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Extravagance, immoderation, overdoing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excesses</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c> <c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c></co></c></i>
