 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Rages, furies, cruelties, brutalities, enormities.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excessive</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Superabundant, disproportionate, undue, too great, superfluous, exuberant.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Extravagant, inordinate, enormous, outrageous, unreasonable, very great.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Immoderate, intemperate, extreme.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Vehement, violent.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excise</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Inland duty, tax upon home products, internal tax <i>or</i> impost <i>or</i> revenue.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excision</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Extirpation, eradication, destruction, extermination, cutting out <i>or</i> off <i>or</i> up.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>excitability</k>
