 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Agitation, perturbation, commotion, sensation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Irritation, warmth, heat, violence, choler, passion.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>exclaim</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Vociferate, shout, call, cry out, call aloud.</dtrn></ar>
