 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Preclusion, rejection.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Prohibition.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Exception, omission, non-inclusion.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Expulsion, ejection.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>exclusive</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Excluding, debarring.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Illiberal, selfish, narrow, uncharitable, narrow-minded.</dtrn>
