 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Detestable, hateful, odious, abhorrent, damnable, cursed, accursed, abominable, villanous.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Offensive, disgusting, obnoxious, nauseous, nauseating, sickening, repulsive, revolting, loathsome, vile.</dtrn></ar>
