 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Law</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Sign, seal, and deliver <c c="gray">(<co><i>as a deed</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>execution</k>
