 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Mode of performance.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Writ <i>or</i> warrant <c c="gray">(<co><i>for carrying out a judgment</i> or <i>sentence</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
