 <dtrn>Triumph, rejoice <c c="gray">(<co><i>for success</i> or <i>victory</i></co>)</c>, leap for joy, be in transport, rejoice excessively, rejoice tauntingly.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>exultant</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Exulting, triumphing, joyous, jubilant, transported, elated.</dtrn></ar>
