<ar><k>fall back</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Recede, retreat, give way, retire, yield.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co>[With <i>on</i> or <i>upon</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Rally, retreat, retire.</dtrn></ar>
