<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>feminality</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>feminine</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Soft, tender, delicate, female. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>womanly</kref>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Effeminate, unmanly, weak.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>feminity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>femininity</b>)</c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Female quality, feminineness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Effeminacy, effeminateness, unmanliness, want of masculine force.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>femur</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Anat.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Thigh-bone.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fen</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Marsh, swamp, bog, moor, morass, quagmire.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fencing</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Manual defence <c c="gray">(<co><i>with small swords</i> or <i>foils</i></co>)</c>, art of self-defence, swordsmanship, fence.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fen-cricket</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Churr-worm, mole-cricket, fan-cricket <c c="gray">(<co><i>Gryllotalpa vulgaris</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fend off</k>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Naut.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Keep off, ward off, keep from collision.</dtrn></ar>
