 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>fenny</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fenny</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Marshy, swampy, boggy, fennish.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ferine</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Wild <c c="gray">(<co><i>as lions, tigers, etc</i>.</co>)</c>, untamed, ferocious, savage, fierce, ravenous, rapacious.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ferocious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Untamed <c c="gray">(<co><i>like a wild beast</i></co>)</c>, savage, fierce, wild, ravenous, rapacious, ferine.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Barbarous, cruel, inhuman, brutal, fell, ruthless, relentless, merciless, pitiless, sanguinary, bloody, Vandalic.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ferocity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Savageness, fierceness, ferociousness, wildness, rapacity.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Barbarity, cruelty, inhumanity.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ferret out</k>
 <dtrn>Search out.</dtrn></ar>
