 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>Fr.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Rural festival, open-air entertainment, out-door party, picnic.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fetich</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Object of superstition <i>or</i> superstitious awe.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Object of unreasoning devotion.</dtrn></ar>
