<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Stench, stink, foul odor, offensive odor, strong smell.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>feud</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Quarrel, broil, contention, clashing, dissension, jarring, rupture, bickering, falling out.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Blood-feud, hereditary enmity, clan-quarrel, family-feud.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Fee, fief.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>feudalism</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Feudal system.</dtrn></ar>
