 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Bonfire.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Firing of guns <c c="gray">(<co><i>for holiday sport</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fever</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Febrile affection, febrile disease.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Heat, flush, agitation, excitement, ferment.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fever-root</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fever-wort, bastard ipecacuanha.</dtrn></ar>
