<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fever-root, bastard ipecacuanha.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Thoroughwort, boneset, ague-weed, Indian sage <c c="gray">(<co><i>Eupatorium perfoliatum</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>few</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Not many, small in number, hardly any, scarcely any.</dtrn></ar>
