<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Paucity, small number.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fey</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co>[<i>Scotch</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Doomed <c c="gray">(<co><i>unconsciously</i></co>)</c>, death-doomed, death-smitten, impelled to foretoken one's own doom, death, <i>or</i> destruction, possessed by fatal propensities.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fiasco</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>It.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Failure, fizzle, abortive attempt, ignominious failure.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fiat</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Decree, order, ordinance, command.</dtrn></ar>
