<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Small fibre, slender thread.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fibrous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Filamentous, stringy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fickle</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Wavering, inconstant, unsteady, unstable, variable, vacillating, volatile, mercurial, changeable, fitful, irresolute, unsettled, capricious, like a weather-cock.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fiction</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Invention, fancy, fantasy, imagination.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Novel, romance, work of fiction, feigned story.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Fabrication, figment, invention, fable, falsehood, lie.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Fictitious literature.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fictitious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Feigned, invented, imaginary, fanciful, unreal, purely ideal.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>False, counterfeit, spurious, supposititious.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fiddle-de-dee</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>interj.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Nonsense, stuff, fudge, moonshine.</dtrn></ar>
