<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Uneasy, restless, impatient.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fiducial</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Confident, undoubting, trustful, firm, steadfast, unwavering, fiduciary.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Exact, precise, true, accurate, permanently accurate.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fief</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fee, feud.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>field</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Tract of land <c c="gray">(<co><i>for tillage</i> or <i>for pasture</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
