<ar><k>fiery</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Igneous, of fire.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Hot, heated, fervid, fervent, glowing, flaming.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Ardent, impetuous, vehement, fierce, passionate, impassioned, fervent, fervid, glowing, flaming.</dtrn></ar>
