 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Ornith.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Becafico, fig-pecker, garden warbler, greater pettychaps <c c="gray">(<co><i>Sylvia hortensis</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fighter</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Combatant, warrior, <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>champion</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>fighting</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Contention, strife, quarrel, warfare, warring.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>figment</k>
