 <dtrn>Shrink, withdraw, retreat, swerve, wince, draw back, hold back.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flindermouse</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Bat, flittermouse, flickermouse.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flinders</k>
