<ar><k>fling up</k>
 <dtrn>Relinquish, abandon.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flippancy</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Volubility, fluency.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Pertness, inconsiderate glibness, unscrupulous smartness, superficial assurance.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flippant</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Voluble, fluent, glib, talkative, nimble of speech, of ready utterance.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Pert, impertinent, malapert, forward, bold, inconsiderately glib, unscrupulously pert.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flirtation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Coquetry, affectation of love.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>flit</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fly rapidly, dart along.</dtrn></ar>
