 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Token, mark, sign, trace, vestige.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>footsteps</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c> <c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Example, footprints, steps, track.</dtrn></ar>
