 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Mild, bland, moderate, kind, tender, compassionate, indulgent, meek, soft, humane, clement, lenient, merciful, of a sweet disposition, gentle-hearted, tender-hearted.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Tame, docile, peaceable, quiet, tractable, pacific, dove-like.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Light, moderate, soft, bland, zephyr-like, mild.</dtrn>
