 <c c="blue">1. </c> <c><co>[<i><c c="green"><abr>Eng.</abr></c></i><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Man of good family <c c="gray">(<co><i>above the rank of yeoman</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Man of good breeding, well-mannered man, refined <i>or</i> polished man, man of delicacy and honor.</dtrn></ar>
