 <c><co>[<i><c c="green"><abr>Eng.</abr></c></i><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Middle class, people of good position <c c="gray">(<co><i>between the nobility and the vulgar</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
