 <dtrn>Gluey, viscous, viscid, sticky, gummy, adhesive, tenacious, clammy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>glutton</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Gormandizer, gourmand, gobbler, greedy-gut, voracious eater, excessive eater, belly-god, belly-slave.</dtrn>
