 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Irreligious, impious, profane, wicked, ungodly.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Atheistical, given to atheism.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>godlike</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Divine, heavenly, supernal, celestial.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>godly</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Pious, holy, righteous, religious, devout, saintly, saint-like, heavenly-minded, Godfearing, profoundly good.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>go down</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Descend.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Be swallowed.</dtrn>
