<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Windfall, unexpected gift, good luck, piece of good fortune, piece of good luck, stroke of fortune.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>godship</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Deity, divinity, godhead.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>go for</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pass for, be taken for, pass current for.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Favor, support, be in favor of, go in for.</dtrn></ar>
