 <dtrn>Be of no use, have no effect <i>or</i> efficacy, be of no avail, be thrown away.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>go forth</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Issue, go out.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Get abroad, become public.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>goggled</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Staring <c c="gray">(<co><i>as a full</i> or <i>prominent eye</i></co>)</c>, rolling.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>goggle-eye</k>
