<ar><k>going on</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Proceeding, advancing.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Progressing, in progress, in hand.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>goings on</k>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Colloq.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Proceedings, conduct.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>go it</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Bear it, accept it, tolerate it, endure it, approve it.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Keep it up, keep on, keep at it, go ahead.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Act recklessly, behave thoughtlessly, live on the rush.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>goitre</k>
