 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Of hell.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Infernal, diabolical, fiendish, devilish, demoniacal, fiend-like, atrocious, detestable, abominable, execrable, nefarious, curst, accursed, damnable, damned, monstrous.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>helm</k>
