 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Helmet, morion, head-piece, casque, armor for the head.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Steering apparatus, rudder, the wheel.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Direction, control, command, rule, reins, post of command.</dtrn></ar>
