 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>humility</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>humdrum</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Dull, prosy, dronish, stupid, wearisome, tiresome, dry, dreary.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>humid</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Wet, moist, damp, dank.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>humidity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Moisture, dampness.</dtrn></ar>
