 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Hillock, knoll, knob of soil.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Ridge, pile, hump, knob, protuberance <c c="gray">(<co><i>in a field of ice</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
