 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Petulant, peevish, snappish, waspish, crusty, captious, perverse, wayward, cross-grained.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Capricious, whimsical, fanciful, fitful, fantastic, odd.</dtrn></ar>
