 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Craving <c c="gray">(<co>food</co>)</c>, of keen appetite, sharp-set, in want of food, famishing <c c="gray">(<co><i>by hyperbole</i></co>)</c>, ravenous.</dtrn>
