 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Unstable, infirm, weak, shaking, tottering.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>insecurity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Uncertainty, risk, riskiness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Danger, hazard, peril.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Dangerousness, hazardousness, perilousness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Instability, weakness, tottering condition <i>or</i> character.</dtrn></ar>
