 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Torpor, lethargy, dulness, want of sensibility.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Apathy, indifference, insusceptibility.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Dulness, stupidity.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Unconsciousness, suspension of consciousness, loss of sensibility, suspension of feeling.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>insensible</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Imperceptible, imperceivable, not discoverable.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Insensate, dull, stupid, torpid, brutish, senseless, without sensibility.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Unfeeling, apathetic, phlegmatic, unsusceptible, unimpressible.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>insensibly</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
