 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Indivisible, not to be separated.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Indissoluble, not to be severed <i>or</i> sundered.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Extremely intimate, constantly together, always in each other's company.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>inseparableness</k>
