 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Impiety, profaneness, profanity, blasphemy, want of reverence.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Disrespect, disesteem, slight, want of respect.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>irreverent</k>
