 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unchangeable, unalterable, irrevocable, irrepealable.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Immutable, invariable, changeless.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>irrevocable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unchangeable. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>irreversible</kref>, 1.</dtrn>
