 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Discernment, understanding, intelligence, discrimination, taste, sagacity, penetration, wisdom, brains, prudence, ballast, depth, sense, mother-wit, quick parts, common-sense, good sense, long head.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Determination, decision, conclusion, opinion, notion, estimate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Law</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Sentence, award, decree.</dtrn>
