 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Vindicate, warrant, defend, maintain, exculpate, excuse, exonerate, set right.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <co><c><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><abr><c c="green"><i>Theol.</i></c></abr></c>)</c></c></co> <dtrn>Absolve, acquit, free from sin, clear from guilt.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Printing</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Adjust.</dtrn></ar>
