 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Piercing, penetrating, cutting.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Severe, bitter, poignant, acrimonious, caustic.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Shrewd, discerning, quick, sagacious, astute, keen-sighted, keen-eyed, clear-sighted, long-headed.</dtrn></ar>
