 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ardor, vehemence, eagerness, earnestness, fervor, zest.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sharpness, acuteness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Severity, rigor, sternness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Causticity, acrimony, asperity, bitterness, pungency.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Poignancy, acuteness, bitterness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Shrewdness, sagacity, astuteness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>keen-sighted</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Keen, sharp-sighted, keen-eyed.</dtrn></ar>
