 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Natural, homogeneal, congenial, kindred, proper, appropriate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sympathetic, benevolent, gracious. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>kind</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>kindness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Benevolence, beneficence, benignity, humanity, generosity, philanthropy, charity, kindliness, sympathy, tenderness, amiability, fellow-feeling, clemency, good feeling.</dtrn>
