<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Relative, relation.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>kit</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Kid, small tub <c c="gray">(<co><i>as for pickled mackerel</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Small pail.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Outfit, working implements.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Violin <c c="gray">(<co><i>small</i></co>)</c>, fiddle.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>kleptomania</k>
