 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Intelligent, skilful, competent, qualified, experienced, accomplished, proficient, well-informed.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Conscious, intelligent, percipient, thinking.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Expressive, significant, cunning.</dtrn></ar>
