<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Industrious, sedulous, assiduous, toiling, hard-working, painstaking. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>diligent</kref>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Difficult, arduous, onerous, toilsome, tiresome, wearisome, fatiguing, irksome, hard, Herculean.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>laboriousness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Toilsomeness, difficulty.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>labor of love</k>
