 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Tear, sever, mangle, rend, lancinate, laniate, claw, tear asunder, tear to pieces.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Harrow, wound, torture, rend.</dtrn></ar>
