<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Playing about <c c="gray">(<co><i>like the tongue in licking</i></co>)</c>, touching lightly, gliding over, licking.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Gleaming, flickering, twinkling.</dtrn></ar>
