 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>L.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Scale, lamina, layer, coat, flake, coating, thin plate.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lamellar</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Lamellate, lamellated, laminar, laminated, foliated, foliaceous, scaly, flaky, schistose.</dtrn></ar>
