<ar><k>lay open</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Open, lance, cut open.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Expose, reveal, exhibit, disclose, unveil, divulge, publish, show, make known.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lay out</k>
