 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Consider seriously, take with serious purpose, ponder well, make matter of earnest resolve.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lay up</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Store, provide, treasure up, lay in.</dtrn>
