 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Cover, covercle, top.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Eyelid.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lie at one's door</k>
 <dtrn>Be chargeable to.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lie by</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Remain near.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Rest, intermit labor.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>lief</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Willingly, gladly, freely.</dtrn></ar>
