 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Min.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Fossil-wood.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>likelihood</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Probability, verisimilitude.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>likely</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Probable, credible.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>In a fair way, to be expected.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Pleasing, agreeable, likable, that may be liked.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Suitable, well-adapted, well-suited, convenient.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>liken</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
