 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Monster, deformed creature.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Blockhead, simpleton, fool, dunce, dolt.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>moonish</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
