<ar><k>mope</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Be sad, be gloomy, be dejected, look downcast, look blue, wear a long face.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Be dull, be listless, be stupid, take no interest in anything, be spiritless, be gloomy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>mope-eyed</k>
