 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Sad, gloomy, downcast, dejected, depressed, desponding, down-hearted, chap-fallen, melancholy, glum, hipped, blue, cast down, in the dumps, with a long face, down in the mouth, out of sorts.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Dull, spiritless, listless, inattentive, stupid.</dtrn></ar>
