 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Thing, reality, particular, existence, fact, phenomenon, percept, thing perceived, external reality.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Mark, aim, target, butt; goal, end, destination; recipient, correlate, <i>or</i> complement <c c="gray">(<i><co>of a conscious subject</co></i>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>End, aim, intent, intention, purpose, design, motive, use, view, drift, goal, final cause.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Gram.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Regimen, complement.</dtrn></ar>
