<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Uneven, not divisible by 2.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unmatched, single <c c="gray">(<co><i>of a pair</i> or <i>set</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Supernumerary, redundant, left over <c c="gray">(<co><i>from a specified number</i></co>)</c>, additional, remaining.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Unheeded.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Retired, secluded.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Incidental, casual, fragmentary.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Unsuitable, inappropriate, queer.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">8. </c> <dtrn>Singular, unusual, extraordinary, queer, quaint, strange, uncommon, eccentric, fantastic, whimsical, peculiar, unique, comical, droll, grotesque, extravagant, out of the way, <i>bizarre</i>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>oddity</k>
