 <dtrn>Deceive, cheat, dupe, outwit, circumvent, defraud, swindle, cozen, gull, trick, victimize, diddle, take in, impose upon.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>override</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pass, ride beyond, outride.</dtrn>
