 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Ride over.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>over-righteous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Sanctimonious, pharisaical.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>overrule</k>
