 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Endurance <c c="gray">(<co><i>without complaint</i></co>)</c>, fortitude, resignation, submission, sufferance, long-sufferance, long-suffering, calmness, composure.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Quietness, calmness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Forbearance, leniency, indulgence, longsuffering.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Perseverance, persistence, indefatigableness, constancy, diligence, assiduity.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>patness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Colloq.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Suitableness, appropriateness, fitness, propriety, aptness, pertinency, convenience.</dtrn></ar>
