 <dtrn>Spectral.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>phantom ship</k>
 <dtrn>Flying Dutchman.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pharaoh</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Hebrew name of the ancient Egyptian monarch.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Faro, pharaon.</dtrn></ar>
