 <dtrn>Egyptian vulture.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pharaoh's rat</k>
 <dtrn>Ichneumon.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pharisaic</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>pharisaical</b>)</c>
 <dtrn>Sanctimonious, hypocritical, formal.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pharisaism</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hypocrisy, formalism, sanctimoniousness, cant, pietism, phariseeism, assumed piety, false piety.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>phariseeism</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>pharisaism</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pharmaceutics</k>
