 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Mucus, excrementitious humor.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Apathy, insensibility, dulness, indifference, coldness, sluggishness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>phlegmatic</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Apathetic, stoical, dull, sluggish, tame, cold, frigid, unfeeling, unsusceptible, impassible, impassive, indifferent, cold-blooded, heavy.</dtrn></ar>
