 <dtrn>Phonetic, pertaining, to sound.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>phonology</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Phonetics, phonics.</dtrn></ar>
