 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Sorry condition, sad plight, predicament <c c="gray">(<co><i><c c="green"><abr>colloq.</abr></c></i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pick off</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pluck, pick, pull off.</dtrn>
