 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Folded, braided, interwoven.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Wrinkled, contracted, knitted.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>plane</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Level, flat, even, smooth, plain.</dtrn></ar>
