 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Strong, forcible, powerful, efficacious, physically strong.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Powerful, mighty, able, efficient, puissant, strong.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Influential, efficacious, cogent, powerful.</dtrn></ar>
