 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>Fr.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Medley, mixture, hotchpotch, hodge-podge, farrago, jumble, miscellany, salmagundi, gallimaufry, olio, mish-mash, confused mass, <i>mélange</i>.</dtrn></ar>
