 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Indigence, penury, want, destitution, need, necessity, privation, neediness, distress, straitened circumstances.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Beggary, mendicancy, pauperism.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Need, lack, want, deficiency, scantiness, sparingness, meagreness, jejuneness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Paucity, exiguity, poorness, smallness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Barrenness, sterility, unproductiveness, unfruitfulness.</dtrn></ar>
