 <dtrn>Direct, order, appoint, command, ordain, dictate, enjoin, decree, institute, establish.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prescript</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Direction, decree, rule, ordinance, law, precept, mandate.</dtrn></ar>
