 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Mien, air, appearance, carriage, port, demeanor.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Presence-chamber, state-room.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presentation</k>
