 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Security, safety, salvation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Integrity, soundness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>preservative</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Conservative, preservatory.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>preservatory</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Preservative.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>preserver</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Saviour, protector, keeper, defender, guardian, safeguard.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Preservative, means of preservation.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>preside</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Direct, control, govern, act as president.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presignify</k>
