 <dtrn>Prefigure, foreshow, preshow, foretoken, foreshadow, portend, augur, betoken.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pressing</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Urgent, importunate, constraining, distressing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pressure</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Compressing, squeezing, crushing.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Influence, constraining force.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Urgency, press, hurry.</dtrn>
