 <dtrn>Quickly, in haste, immediately, suddenly.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presumable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Probable, reasonable, likely, credible, that stands to reason.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presumption</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Opinion, belief, supposition, conjecture, guess, anticipation, hypothesis, assumption, understanding, condition, concession.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Arrogance, forwardness, audacity, boldness, assurance, effrontery, brass, presumptuousness.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Probability, ground for believing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presumptive</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Grounded on probable evidence, probable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presumptive evidence</k>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Law</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Circumstantial <i>or</i> indirect evidence.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presumptuous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Arrogant, bold, forward, presuming, insolent, audacious.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Rash, over-confident, foolhardy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Irreverent.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>presuppose</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Imply as antecedent, assume, presume, surmise, suppose, take for granted.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pretence</k>
