<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Equivocation, cavil, quibbling, shuffling.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prevenient</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Preliminary, prefatory, antecedent, initiatory, introductory, going before, preceding.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Preventing, preventive.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prevent</k>
