 <dtrn>Obstruct, stop, hinder, impede, thwart, intercept, preclude, interrupt, obviate, debar.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prevention</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Obstruction, stoppage, hindrance, interruption.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>previous</k>
