<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Foresight, foreknowledge, prescience.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prey</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Plunder, booty, spoil, pillage, rapine, loot.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Ravin, food, victim, quarry.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Ravage, depredation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Victim.</dtrn></ar>
