 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Plunder, pillage, rob, despoil.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Devour, feed upon.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Waste, corrode, waste gradually.</dtrn></ar>
