 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Recompense, reward, compensation.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>priceless</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Invaluable, inestimable, without price.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Without value, worthless <i>or</i> unsalable, unvalued.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prickle</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Little prick, thorn, spine; small, sharp-pointed projection.</dtrn></ar>
