 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Secretly.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Personally, individually.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>private parts</k>
 <dtrn>Genitals, sexual organs.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>privation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
