<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Likely, presumable, credible, reasonable, to be expected, that stands to reason.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>probably</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Apparently, to all appearance, in all probability, in likelihood, with appearance of truth.</dtrn></ar>
