 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Novitiate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Moral trial, ordeal, test, essay.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Examination, trial.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Proof.</dtrn></ar>
