 <dtrn>Integrity, uprightness, honesty, worth, rectitude, virtue, goodness, righteousness, trustworthiness, trustiness, principle, sincerity, truthfulness, veracity, honor, conscientiousness, justice, equity, fairness, incorruptibility, soundness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>problem</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Question <c c="gray">(<co><i>to be solved</i></co>)</c>, enigma, puzzle, riddle, moot point, point in dispute, point to be solved <i>or</i> settled, question at issue, vexed question.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>problematic</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>problematical</b>)</c>
 <dtrn>Uncertain, doubtful, dubious, questionable, disputable, enigmatical, puzzling, unsettled.</dtrn></ar>
