 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Announce, publish, declare, promulgate, advertise, trumpet, broach, cry, make known, blaze abroad, spread abroad, noise abroad, bruit, give notice of, make proclamation of.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Outlaw <c c="gray">(<co><i>by public denunciation</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
