 <c c="blue">6. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Law.</i></c>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Rest upon, submit to.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>put one's shoulder to the wheel</k>
 <dtrn>Render assistance, lend a hand, help.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>put out</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Eject, expel, drive out.</dtrn>
