<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Putridness, rottenness, corruption, putrefaction.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>put the hand to</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Apply, take hold, begin, undertake.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Steal, purloin, filch.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>put to</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unite, add to.</dtrn>
