<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hoarse, husky, rough, harsh.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>rave</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Rage, be mad, be wild, be furious, rant.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Be delirious, talk irrationally, wander.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ravel</k>
