<ar><k>ray</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Beam, gleam.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Perception, vision, sight, apprehension, notice, intellectual light, beam.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>rayed</k>
