 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Prepared, in readiness, fitted.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Prompt, quick, expeditious.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Apt, expert, dexterous, keen, prompt, nimble, unhesitating, facile, adroit, clever, quick, sharp, smart, skilful, handy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Willing, disposed, inclined, free, cheerful.</dtrn>
