<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Healthy, healthful, salubrious, wholesome, salutiferous, helpful, safe.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Advantageous, beneficial, serviceable, good, useful, profitable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>salutation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Greeting, salute, address.</dtrn></ar>
