<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Healthy, healthful, salutary, salubrious, wholesome.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>salvation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Preservation, deliverance, rescue, escape from danger.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Redemption, deliverance.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>salver</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Waiter, tray.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>salvo</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Exception, reservation, excuse, saving.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Volley, general discharge <c c="gray">(<co><i>of fire-arms</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sal-volatile</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Sesqui-carbonate of ammonia, carbonate of ammonia, smelling-salts, salt of hartshorn.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sambucus</k>
