 <dtrn>Elder-tree.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>same</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Identical.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Similar, like, corresponding; of like kind, sort, <i>or</i> degree.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sameness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Identity, identicalness, oneness.</dtrn>
