 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>Fr.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Coolness, unconcern, indifference, calmness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sangreal</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Grail, holy dish.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanguisuge</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Bloodsucker, leech.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanitary</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hygienic.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanitation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hygiene.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanitory</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Therapeutic, remedial, curative, healing, curing. See Sanatory.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanity</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Saneness, soundness, rationality.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sanpan</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co>[Written also <i>Sampan</i> and <i>Scampan</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Chinese boat.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sans-culotte</k>
