 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ragamuffin, tatter-demalion, ragged fellow.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Jacobin, radical, republican.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sans souci</k>
 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>Fr.</abr></c><c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Without care, with unconcern, free and easy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sapid</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Savory, relishing, tasteful, palatable.</dtrn></ar>
