 <dtrn>Wisdom, sageness, knowledge, sagacity, shrewdness, intelligence, sense.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sapient</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Wise, sage, sagacious, sensible, discerning, shrewd, acute, intelligent, knowing.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sapless</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Without sap, destitute of sap.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Decayed, dry, old, withered.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>saponaceous</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Soapy.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sapor</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Taste, flavor, savor, relish, smack.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sappiness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Juiciness, succulence.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sappy</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Juicy, succulent.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Young, weak, soft.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Weak, silly, foolish.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sap-rot</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Dry-rot.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>saracen</k>
