 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Gratification.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Contentment, content, enjoyment, ease, comfort, pleasure, complacency.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Compensation, amends, requital, remuneration, indemnification, reparation, atonement, recompense, reward.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Discharge, payment.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>satisfactory</k>
