 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Gratifying, pleasing.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sufficient, conclusive, convincing, decisive.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Compensating, atoning, that makes amends.</dtrn></ar>
