 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Confine, limit, constrict, contract, constrain.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Narrow.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Stretch, straighten, make tight <i>or</i> tense.</dtrn>
