 <c><co><c c="gray">[</c><c c="green"><abr>L.</abr></c> <i><c c="violet"><abr>pl.</abr></c> Striae</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Furrow, groove, channel.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>striate</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>; <c c="gray">(<i>also</i> <b>striated</b>)</c>
 <dtrn>Channelled, furrowed, grooved.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>stricken</k>
