 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Struck, smitten, wounded, afflicted.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Advanced <c c="gray">(<co><i>in years</i></co>)</c>, far gone, worn out, aged, venerable, time-worn.</dtrn></ar>
