 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Labor, endeavor, toil, struggle, try, aim, exert one's self, make an effort, do one's best, lay one's self out.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Contend, contest, fight, have a contest.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Compete, cope, strive together, contend, struggle.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Poetical</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Vie, compete, compare, be comparable.</dtrn></ar>
