 <dtrn>Offender, trespasser, culprit, delinquent, sinner, evil-doer.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transient</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Passing, fleeting, temporary, soon past, soon passing, flying, flitting, brief, fugitive.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Hasty, momentary, imperfect, short.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transiently</k>
