 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Conveyance, passage.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Line of passage, line of conveyance.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Passage <c c="gray">(<co><i>as of a heavenly body across the meridian</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transition</k>
