 <dtrn>Transitional.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transitive</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Gram.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Active.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transitory</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Transient, passing, fleeting, flitting, flying, temporary, evanescent, ephemeral, momentary, short, brief, fugacious, short-lived, of short duration, here to-day and gone to-morrow.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>translate</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <c><co>[<i>Antiquated</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Remove, transport.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Transfer.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Render, construe, interpret.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Transform, change into another form.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>translation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Removal, transportation, conveyance, carriage.</dtrn>
