 <c c="blue">5. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Metastasis, change in the seat of a disease.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>translucency</k>
