 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Semi-transparency, translucence, pellucidity, pellucidness, diaphaneity.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>transparence</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>translucent</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Semi-transparent <c c="gray">(<co><i>admitting rays of light, but not capable of being distinctly seen through</i></co>)</c>, pellucid, diaphanous.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>transparent</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transmigrate</k>
