 <dtrn>Changeable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transmutation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Transformation, metamorphosis, transfiguration.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Geom.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Change, reduction, conversion.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transmute</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Change <c c="gray">(<co><i>from one form</i> or <i>nature into another</i></co>)</c>, transform.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transom</k>
