 <dtrn>Clearness, lucidity, limpidness, translucency.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transparent</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Clear, lucid, bright, limpid, crystalline, transpicuous, translucent, that may be seen through.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Open, porous, transpicuous.</dtrn>
