<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Evaporate <c c="gray">(<co><i>through the pores</i></co>)</c>, exhale, pass off in vapor.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Become known, be disclosed, come to light, come out, be made public, get abroad, leak out, appear.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transplant</k>
