<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Change the order of <c c="gray">(<co><i>by putting one in place of the other</i>, or <i>substituting one for the other</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>transposition</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
