 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Dress, ornaments, embellishments, decorations, frippery, paraphernalia, rigging, gear, livery, adornments.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Equipments, accoutrements, caparisons, gear.</dtrn></ar>
