 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Decipher, unravel, unriddle, explain, resolve, disentangle, interpret, evolve, illustrate, make known, set forth, make clear.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Display, spread out, set to view.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Release, dismiss from a fold.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unforced</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Willing, unconstrained, uncompelled.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Free, unurged, nothing loath.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Natural, unfeigned, spontaneous.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Easy, ready, voluntary, willing.</dtrn></ar>
