<ar><k>ungraceful</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Stiff, constrained, awkward, clumsy, inelegant, ungainly, uncouth, gawky.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ungracious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Uncivil, unkind, impolite, rude, rough, unfriendly, disobliging, churlish, unamiable.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unpleasing, disagreeable, ungrateful, offensive, unacceptable, unpleasant, thankless.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>ungrammatical</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
