<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unspotted, unstained, untarnished, unsoiled, spotless, clean.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Pure, untainted, uncorrupted, undefiled, immaculate, unspoiled.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unsupplied</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unprovided, unfurnished, destitute.</dtrn></ar>
