 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unassisted, unaided.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unseconded, unsustained, unupheld.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unsurpassed</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unexcelled, matchless, unequalled, unmatched, unparalleled, unrivalled, unexampled, peerless, unparagoned, without an equal.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unsusceptible</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unimpressible, unimpressionable, impassive, apathetic, cold, phlegmatic, stoical, insusceptible.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unsuspecting</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unsuspicious, credulous, trusting, confiding.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unsuspicious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unsuspecting, having no suspicion.</dtrn></ar>
