 <dtrn>Irregular, disorderly, immethodical.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untainted</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pure, clean, wholesome, fresh, sweet, healthy.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Pure, uncorrupted, undefiled, unspotted, unsullied, untarnished, immaculate, unstained.</dtrn></ar>
