<ar><k>untarnished</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unspotted, unsullied, unstained, unsoiled, spotless, clean, unblemished.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untaught</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Ignorant, uninstructed, uneducated, untutored, untrained, uninformed, unenlightened, unlettered, illiterate.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untaxed</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Scot-free, without payment, without expense.</dtrn>
