<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Indocile, untractable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untenable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unmaintainable, indefensible, unsound.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Weak, hollow, fallacious, unjustifiable, indefensible.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untenanted</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Unoccupied, tenantless, uninhabited, empty, deserted.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unterrified</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Undaunted, unscared, undismayed, unappalled, unawed, fearless.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthankful</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Ungrateful, thankless, without gratitude.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthinking</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Thoughtless, heedless, careless, inconsiderate, unreflecting.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthoughtful</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Thoughtless, inconsiderate, heedless, careless.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthought of</k>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unconsidered, undreamed of.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unheeded, neglected, forgotten, overlooked, disregarded.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthrift</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Rare</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Prodigal, spendthrift, squanderer.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unthrifty</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Thriftless, wasteful, lavish, profuse, prodigal, improvident, extravagant.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untidy</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Slovenly, disorderly, unneat.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>untie</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Loose, loosen, unfasten, unbind, unloose.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Let loose, unbind.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Resolve, solve, clear, unfold.</dtrn></ar>
