 <dtrn>Disentangle, ravel, unravel.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unused</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Unemployed, untried.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unaccustomed, new, unfamiliar.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unusual</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Uncommon, rare, unwonted, singular, remarkable, strange, curious, extraordinary, odd, queer, out of the way.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unutterable</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Inexpressible, ineffable, unspeakable, indescribable, that cannot be uttered, beyond expression.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>unvacillating</k>
