 <dtrn>Immediately, at once, on the spot.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>upon the whole</k>
 <dtrn>All things considered, in view of all the circumstances, taking everything into account, on the whole.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>upper classes</k>
