<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Rare.</i></c>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Find fault with, scold, censure, overwhelm with abuse, abuse, vilify, revile, reproach, berate, rate, upbraid, rail at, objurgate.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>vituperation</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Abuse, blame, reproach, reviling, upbraiding, railing, objurgation, invective, scolding, severe censure.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>vituperative</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Abusive, reproachful, scolding, scurrilous, opprobrious, condemnatory, damnatory, contemptuous, insulting.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>vivacious</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Lively, sprightly, brisk, animated, spirited, gay, sportive, frolicsome, jocund, merry, cheerful, mirthful, pleasant, full of life, buxom.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>vivaciousness</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Vivacity, activity, liveliness.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>vivacity</k>
