 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>While, whereas.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Which time, then.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>whence</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>From what place.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>From what cause, from what source, how.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>whenever</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>At whatever time, whensoever.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>whensoever</k>
