 <dtrn><co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>whenever</kref>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>where</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>At which place, in which place.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>At what place, in what place.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Whither, to what, to which place <i><c c="gray">(<co>recent</co>)</c></i>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>whereas</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>conj.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Since, considering that, it being the case that.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>When in fact, while on the contrary.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>whereby</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>By which.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>wherefore</k>
