 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Why, for what cause <i>or</i> reason, on what account.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Why, for what reason.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>For which reason.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>wherein</k>
