 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Of which.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Of what.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>wheresoever</k>
<i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>ad.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>In what place soever, in what-ever place, wherever.</dtrn></ar>
