<ar><k>catch</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Grasp, seize, snatch, clutch, gripe, grasp, lay hold of, fasten upon.</dtrn>
