 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Take <c c="gray">(<co><i>as a disease</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Take unawares, surprise, come suddenly on.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Lay hold, take hold, hold.</dtrn>
