<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Vary, modify, make different, make some change in. <co><c c="green"><i><c>See</c></i></c></co> <kref>alter</kref>.</dtrn>
