 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Exchange, barter, commute, give in exchange.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Give small coin <c c="gray">(<co><i>or</i> bills</co>)</c>, in exchange for.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Alter, vary, shift, veer, turn, undergo change, change about.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Alteration, variation, mutation, transition, transmutation, revolution.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Vicissitude, variety, novelty, innovation.</dtrn>
