<ar><k>hazard</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Chance, casualty, accident, fortuitous event.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Danger, peril, risk, jeopardy.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Venture, adventure, risk.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Jeopard, peril, imperil, endanger, put in danger, put at hazard.</dtrn></ar>
