 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Be told, be informed, have an account, learn.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>heat</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Caloric.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Warmth.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Degree of temperature.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Excitement, flush, vehemence, impetuosity, violence, passion, fever.</dtrn>
