 <dtrn>Herbarium, herbary, hortus siccus.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>herd</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Drove <c c="gray">(<co><i>of the larger animals</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Crowd, rabble, multitude, populace, vulgar herd <c c="gray">(<i><co>ignobile vulgus</co></i>)</c>.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Associate <c c="gray">(<co><i>as beasts</i></co>)</c>, keep company.</dtrn></ar>
