<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Execrate, denounce, hiss, cry down, cry out against, hoot at.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Shout <i>or</i> cry <i>or</i> outcry <i>or</i> yell of contempt.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>hop</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Spring <i>or</i> leap on one leg <i>or</i> foot.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Leap, bound, jump, skip, spring, caper, frisk, frisk about.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Dance, trip.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Limp, halt, hobble, walk lame.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Leap, bound, jump, spring, skip, caper.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Dance.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>hope</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Trust, confidence, faith, reliance.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Expectancy, trustful longing, waiting under the possibility of fulfilment, sense of possible fulfilment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Possibility of good, chance of the desired end, room for expectation, chance of a favorable result.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Reliance, dependence, object of trust <i>or</i> reliance, ground of confidence.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Await <c c="gray">(<co><i>something agreeable</i></co>)</c>, hope for, trustingly long for.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Trust, wait in trustful longing, indulge <i>or</i> entertain a hope, be in hopes, live in hopes, look on the bright side, flatter one's self.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>horn</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Bony excrescence <i>or</i> projection.</dtrn>
