 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Cusp, curved extremity, prong, wing <c c="gray">(<co><i>of a battle line</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="darkorange"><abr><co><c><i>v. a.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fit <i>or</i> furnish with horns, shape like a horn.</dtrn>
