 <c c="blue">3. </c> <c><co>[With <i>up</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Make hurriedly, contrive carelessly, fudge up.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <co><c>[With <i>on</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></c></co> <dtrn>Hurry on, hustle on, put on in disorder.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
