 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Cloak.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Cover, covering.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Mantel-piece, mantel-shelf.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Pallium.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Cloak, overspread, cover, disguise, obscure.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Expand, spread, be expanded.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Effervesce, bubble, foam, sparkle, froth, cream.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>manual</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
