<ar><k>manufacture</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Production, fabrication, making.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Manufactured product.</dtrn>
