 <dtrn>Bewilder, amaze, confuse, perplex confound.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>mean</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Middle, medium, average, moderate.</dtrn>
