 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Sordid, penurious, miserly, stingy, niggardly, illiberal, ungenerous, selfish, narrow, mercenary, narrow-minded, parsimonious.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Small, little, paltry, insignificant, diminutive, petty, poor, wretched, contemptible, despicable.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="green"><abr><co><c><i>n.</i></c></co></abr></c>
