 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Intend, signify, contemplate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Intend, purpose, design.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Signify, indicate, imply, denote, purport, import, express.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">IV</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Intend, purpose, design.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>meander</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Labyrinth, maze, winding course, perplexity, intricacy.</dtrn>
