 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Monument, commemorative record, memento.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Memorandum, record, remembrancer.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
