 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Repair, refit, retouch, patch up, touch up, restore.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Improve, ameliorate, meliorate, correct, rectify, reform, amend, emend, make better.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Help, advance, further, improve.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Increase, add to, augment, make greater.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Improve, amend, become better.</dtrn></ar>
