 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Hired, purchased, paid, hireling, venal.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sordid, avaricious, covetous, penurious, parsimonious, stingy, miserly, niggardly, mean, selfish, close.</dtrn>
