<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Deserve, have a right to, be entitled to, earn.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Deserve, incur.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Profit, gain value, receive benefit, acquire desert.</dtrn></ar>
