 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Medley, mixture, miscellany, mass, farrago, hotch-potch, hodge-podge, jumble, salmagundi, mish-mash, olio, confused mass, <i>mélange</i>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Muddle, predicament, plight, confusion, perplexity, pickle <c c="gray">(<co><i><c c="green"><abr>colloq.</abr></c></i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Eat in company, take meals at the same table.</dtrn></ar>
