 <dtrn>Gull, sea-mew, cob, sea-cob.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="darkorange"><abr><co><c><i>v. a.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Confine, encase, coop, imprison, shut up, enclose.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Shed <c c="gray">(<co><i>feathers</i></co>)</c>, moult, cast, change.</dtrn></ar>
