<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Strong, powerful, robust, vigorous, sturdy, puissant, courageous, valiant, valorous, bold, able.</dtrn>
