 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Belief, opinion, thought, sentiment, reflection, contemplation, consideration, judgment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Memory, remembrance, recollection.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Courage, spirit.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Notice, note, heed, regard, mark, attend to, take notice of, pay attention to, give heed to, fix the mind on.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Obey, be obedient to, attend to, regard with submission, observe.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <co><c><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Poetical</i></c>.)</c></c></co> <dtrn>Remind, put in mind.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
