<ar><k>mount</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co>[<i>Used before a proper name and in poetry</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Mountain, high hill.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="darkorange"><abr><co><c><i>v. n.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Rise, ascend, arise, uprise, soar, go up, rise on high.</dtrn>
