 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Get on horseback.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Amount, attain in value, count up.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ascend, climb, scale, escalade, get upon.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Put <i>or</i> raise <c c="gray">(<co><i>upon something</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
