 <c c="blue">4. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Mil.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Carry, be furnished with.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Prepare, make ready.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Get upon, bestride.</dtrn></ar>
