<ar><k>muse</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Revery, abstraction, musing, deep thought, brown study, absence of mind, musing.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ponder, meditate, contemplate, reflect, cogitate, deliberate, ruminate, think, brood.</dtrn>
