 <dtrn>Original inhabitant.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>natural</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Of nature.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Original, indigenous, native.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Essential, characteristic, native.</dtrn>
