 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Affectionate, kind.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Unaffected, real, genuine, simple, ingenuous, artless, spontaneous.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Unregenerate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">8. </c> <dtrn>Life-like.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">9. </c> <dtrn>Illegitimate, bastard.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Fool, simpleton, idiot.</dtrn></ar>
