 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Halberd, pike.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Quarter-staff.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Factionary, biassed.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>partition</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Division, separation.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Dividing wall, division wall, barrier, screen.</dtrn>
