 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Persevering, persistent, diligent, assiduous, indefatigable, constant.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Invalid, sufferer, sick person.</dtrn></ar>
