 <dtrn>Steal, thieve, practise petty theft.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pillage</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Spoliation, depredation, destruction, devastation, plundering, rapine.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Plunder, booty, spoil, prey.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Plunder, spoil, despoil, sack, strip, rifle.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pilot</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Steersman, helmsman.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Guide, director, conductor.</dtrn>
