 <dtrn>Guide, direct, conduct, steer, have <i>or</i> take the direction of.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>pimp</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Procurer, pander.</dtrn>
