<ar><k>pin</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Peg, bolt.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Straw <c c="gray">(<co><i>as something of no value</i></co>)</c>, fig, button, rush, feather, farthing, brass farthing, trifle.</dtrn>
