 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Cause, occasion, originate, make, create, effect, give rise to, bring, about.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Yield, bear, give, afford, render, make accrue, impart.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Extend, protract, prolong, draw out, lengthen.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Manufacture, make.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
