 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Mysterious, occult, abstruse, obscure, recondite.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Thorough, complete.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Deep-fetched.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>The deep, the abyss.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sea, ocean.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prognostic</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
