<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Advancement, advance, progression, movement forward.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Growth, increase, improvement, development.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Journey of state, circuit.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Advance, proceed.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Take head, make headway, work one's way, make one's way, make progress, proceed, continue, onward.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>project</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Throw, cast, throw out, shoot forward.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Scheme, devise, contrive, frame, intend, plan, plot, concoct, brew.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Delineate <c c="gray">(<i><co>as a sphere upon a plane</co></i>)</c>, draw, exhibit.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Protrude, jut, bulge, jut out, stand out, be prominent, shoot forward.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Plan, scheme, contrivance, device, design, proposal, purpose.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>promenade</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Walk, stroll.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Walk, sidewalk, place for walking.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Take a walk.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>promise</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Word, engagement, assurance, pledge.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Ground <i>or</i> basis of hope, earnest, pledge.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Bestowal, fulfilment, grant of what is promised.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="darkorange"><abr><co><c><i>v. a.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Pledge, engage, covenant.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Give expectation of, excite a hope of, assure.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Pledge, engage to bestow.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Engage, agree, stipulate, bargain, be sworn, pledge one's self, plight one's word, pass one's word, give assurance, make an agreement, tie one's self.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prompt</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ready, quick, apt, alert, active.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Ready, willing.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Quick, ready.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Hasty, forward, quick.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Inclined, disposed, apt, propense.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Early, timely, punctual.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Incite, induce, stimulate, impel, incline, dispose, urge, set on, draw on, instigate.</dtrn>
