 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Test, trial, essay, ordeal, examination.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Demonstration, certification, attestation, satisfactory evidence, confirmation, testimony.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Proof-sheet, trial impression.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Firm, steadfast, stable, fixed, impenetrable.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>prop</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Support, sustain, uphold, hold up, shore up.</dtrn>
