 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Revoke, retract, recant, repeal, abjure, rescind, annul, overrule, cancel, nullify, countermand, set aside.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Recollect, remember, recall to mind.</dtrn>
