<ar><k>reckon</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Count, number, compute, calculate, enumerate, cast, cast up.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Estimate, esteem, account, regard, repute, value.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Compute, calculate, estimate, cast account.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>recline</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Lean.</dtrn>
