 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Couch, lie, lie down, be recumbent.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Rest, repose.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>recluse</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Secluded, sequestered, retired, solitary, shut up.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Hermit, anchoret, solitary, solitaire, anchorite, eremite, ascetic.</dtrn></ar>
