 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Repair, replenish, supply, lack.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Refresh, revive, restore, renovate, renew, recover, reinvigorate, regain, retreive.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <co><c><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Mil.</abr></c></i>)</c></c></co> <dtrn>Reinforce, supply with new men.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
