<ar><k>regard</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Observe, notice, mark, remark, watch, behold, set eyes on, look at, look upon, turn one's eyes.</dtrn>
