<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Reservation, something reserved.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Constraint, restraint, backwardness, cautious behavior, coldness, closeness, reservedness, retention, uncommunicativeness, reticence.</dtrn>
