 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Confirm, fix in resolution.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Prepare, make ready in mind.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Reduce, change.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">8. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><abr><c c="green"><i>Math.</i></c></abr></c>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Solve.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">9. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<i><c c="green"><abr>Med.</abr></c></i>)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Disperse, scatter.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">10. </c> <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Legislation</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Declare, determine on, express.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Dissolve, melt, liquefy, become fluid.</dtrn>
