<ar><k>rook</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Castle <c c="gray">(<co><i>in chess</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Cheat, trickish fellow.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Cheat, defraud, rob, ruck, cower.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Squat, sit close.</dtrn>
