 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Eradicate, tear out, exterminate, extirpate, destroy utterly, remove utterly.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Dig, burrow with the snout.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>rope</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Draw as by a rope, fasten, tie.</dtrn>
