<ar><k>rough</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Uneven, rugged, craggy, cragged, jagged, scraggy, scabrous.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Unhewn, unwrought, unfashioned, formless, shapeless.</dtrn>
