 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Ample, extensive, broad.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Encompassing, encircling.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
