 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Trip, excursion, journey.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Clamor, outcry, protest, popular censure.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Pressure, demand, urgent application.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Generality, people <i>or</i> things as they are, people <i>or</i> things of average quality.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">8. </c> <dtrn>Brook, streamlet, runlet, runnel, rivulet, rill, small stream, burn.</dtrn></ar>
