<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Close, fasten, secure.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Confirm, ratify, establish, sanction, authenticate, attest.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Keep close, keep secret, shut close, make fast.</dtrn>
