 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Probe.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Examine, try, test.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Seek, look, make search, hunt.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Inquire, make inquiry.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Examination, inquiry, scrutiny, research, exploration, investigation, quest, pursuit, inspection, seeking.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>season</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Period of the year.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Time, conjuncture, fit time, convenient time, suitable time.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>While, time, spell, term, interval, period.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Habituate, accustom, acclimatize, mature, inure, harden, form, train, fit by habit.</dtrn>
