 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Make palatable, give relish to, spice.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Moderate, temper, qualify.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Gratify, tickle.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Taint, tinge, imbue.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Be seasoned, become seasoned.</dtrn></ar>
