<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Place, station, locate, establish, fix, set, settle, situate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Cause to sit.</dtrn>
