 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Secondary, inferior.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Maintainer, supporter, helper, assistant, backer.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Sixtieth part of a minute.</dtrn>
