<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Behold, descry, view.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Perceive, notice, observe, discern, distinguish, know, remark, comprehend, understand, conceive.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Visit, call on.</dtrn>
