 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Experience, feel, suffer, know, meet with.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Look.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Inquire, examine, notice, mark, observe, distinguish, consider.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Take heed, take care, be careful, beware, be attentive, pay attention.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Perceive, penetrate, discern, understand, look.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">IV</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>interj.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Look, lo, behold, observe.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>seeing</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Sight, vision.</dtrn>
