 <dtrn>Considering, since, because, inasmuch as, for the reason that, it being so.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>seek</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Search for, seek for, look for, look after, try to find.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Solicit, ask, inquire for, try to get, endeavor to gain.</dtrn>
