 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Inspection, examination.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Eye <i>or</i> eyes.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>See, perceive, get sight of.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sign</k>
