<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Smile <c c="gray">(<co><i>affectedly</i></co>)</c>, smirk.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Smirk, affected smile.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>simple</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Single, uncombined, unmingled, uncompounded, unmixed, elementary, bare, mere, incomplex, unblended.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Plain, unadorned, unstudied, unaffected, unvarnished, natural, chaste, neat, unembellished.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Artless, undesigning, sincere, unaffected, unconstrained, frank, open, downright, inartificial, plain, single-minded, unsophisticated, straightforward, true, simple-hearted, simple-minded, <i>naïve</i>.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Silly, foolish, weak, credulous, shallow, unwise, unsophisticated, homely.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Unmistakable, clear, intelligible.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Medicinal plant.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>sin</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Offence <c c="gray">(<i><co>against the divine law</co></i>)</c>, transgression, iniquity, unrighteousness, wickedness, moral depravity, wrong, delinquency.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Offence, transgression.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Trespass, do wrong, transgress.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>since</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>conj.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Because, as, considering, seeing that, because that, inasmuch as.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="green"><abr><co><c><i>ad.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Ago, before this.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>From that time.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>prep.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>After, from the time of, subsequently to.</dtrn></ar>
