 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Sole, one only.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Particular, individual, separate.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Unmarried, unwedded.</dtrn>
