<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Leap, jump, bound, spring, hop, caper.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Disregard, omit, neglect, miss, skip over, pass without notice.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Leap, jump, bound, spring, hop, caper.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>skirt</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Flap, loose part <c c="gray">(<co><i>of a garment below the waist</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn>
