<ar><k>strip</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Tear off, pull off, strip off.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Uncover, denude, peel, lay bare.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Divest, deprive, bereave, despoil, fleece, shave, make destitute.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Unrig, dismantle.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Rob, plunder, pillage, spoil, sack, ransack, devastate, desolate, lay waste.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Fleece, rob, plunder, despoil.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">7. </c> <dtrn>Milk dry.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Undress, uncover, take off the clothes.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Piece <c c="gray">(<co><i>long and narrow, torn off</i></co>)</c>, slip, shred.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>stripe</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Streak.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <c c="green"><abr><co><c><i>n.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Streak.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Stroke <c c="gray">(<co><i>with a lash</i></co>)</c>, blow, lash.</dtrn>
