 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Slab, tablet.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Stand <c c="gray">(<co><i>to take food from</i></co>)</c>, board.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Food, diet, provision, fare, repast, victuals, entertainment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Table-company.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">5. </c> <dtrn>Index, list, catalogue, syllabus.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">6. </c> <dtrn>Synopsis, condensed statement.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Flat, plain, level, even.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>taboo</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c><co>[Written also <i>Tabu</i>.<c c="gray">]</c></co></c> <dtrn>Interdict, prohibition.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Interdict, forbid, prohibit, put under taboo, put under an interdict, forbid to be used <i>or</i> touched.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>tack</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Fasten <c c="gray">(<co><i>slightly</i></co>)</c>, attach, append, affix, tag.</dtrn>
