 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Cue, catchword.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Game of tag, tig.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Attach a tag to, fit with a tag.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Fasten, attach, append, affix, tack, join, add to.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>tail</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Caudal appendage, hinder part.</dtrn>
