<ar><k>take</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Receive, accept.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Seize, grasp, gripe, clasp, lay hold of, get hold of.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Entrap, ensnare, circumvent.</dtrn>
