<c c="blue">I</c>. 
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Neuter</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Complain, lament, be much affected.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. 
 <c><co><c c="gray">(<c c="green"><i>Active</i></c>.)</c></co></c> <dtrn>Assume, be willing to bear, take upon, take up.</dtrn></ar>
