<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Speak, converse.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Confer, reason, deliberate.</dtrn>
