 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Speak, use for conversing.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Speak, utter, mention in speaking.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">III</c>. <c c="green"><abr><co><c><i>n.</i></c></co></abr></c>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Conversation, converse, colloquy, discourse, conference, communication, dialogue, confabulation, chat, parley, oral intercourse.</dtrn>
