<ar><k>tame</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Domesticated, domestic, mild, gentle, docile, reclaimed.</dtrn>
