<ar><k>tangle</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Interweave <c c="gray">(<co><i>confusedly</i></co>)</c>, intertwine, complicate, perplex, snarl, entangle, mat.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Entrap, ensnare, catch.</dtrn>
