<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Complication, intricacy, perplexity, snarl.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Perplexity, embarrassment.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">3. </c> <dtrn>Tang, sea-tang, oar-weed, sea-girdles <c c="gray">(<co><i>Laminaria digitata</i></co>)</c>.</dtrn></ar>
<ar><k>tap</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
