<ar><k>tarnish</k>
<c c="blue">I</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Soil, stain, sully, deface, dim, discolor, dull, blemish.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>n.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <dtrn>Soil, stain, spot, blemish, blot.</dtrn></ar>
