 <c c="blue">4. </c> <dtrn>Be excited, be roused up, be active.</dtrn>
<c c="blue">II</c>. <i><c><co><c c="darkorange"><abr>v. a.</abr></c></co></c></i>
 <c c="blue">1. </c> <dtrn>Awaken, waken, rouse from sleep.</dtrn>
 <c c="blue">2. </c> <dtrn>Arouse, rouse, excite, kindle, stimulate, provoke, stir up, put in motion, animate, put in action, summon up.</dtrn>
